<title>USA: SA Telecom names interim president.</title>
<headline>SA Telecom names interim president.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>SA Telecommunications Inc said on Thursday that it has named John Nugent interim president and chief operating officer, replacing Paul Miller.</p>
<p>Nugent was previously vice president of acquisitions and business development and is a director of the company, SA said in a statement.</p>
</text>
